&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;1. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;안녕하십니까&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;항상 군정 발전에 깊은 관심을 가져주심에 감사의 말씀을 드리며&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;국민&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;신문고를 통해 올리신 민원&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;○○○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;○○○○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;○○○○○○○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;에 대한 답변을 다음과 같이 드립니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;2. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;귀하께서 제출하신 민원내용은 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;생계급여 수급자 부정수급&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;에&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;관한 것으로 이해됩니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;3. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;귀하의 질의에 대한 답변은 다음과 같습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;생계급여란&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;「&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;국민기초생활 보장법&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;」&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;에 따른 급여 중 수급자에게 옷&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;식품 등 일상생활에&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;필요한 금품을 지급하여 생계를 유지하도록 지원하는 제도입니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;나&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;「&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;국민기초생활 보장법&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;」 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;제&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;46&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;조에 따라 부정한 방법으로 급여를 받은 경우 보장비용을 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;지급한 보장기관은 그 비용의 전부 또는 일부를 급여를 받은 자로부터 징수할 수 있습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;이에 따라 신고된 사항에 대하여 대상자의 수급 자격 및 소득&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;재산 사항 등을 확인하고&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;있으며&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;부정 수급이 확인될 경우 관련 규정에 따라 조치할 예정입니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;라&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;다만&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;「&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;국민기초생활보장법&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;」 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;제&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;22&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;조제&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;항에 따라 신고 대상자의 급여 이력 등의 개인정보와&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;부정수급 조사결정 결과에 관한 자세한 사항은 안내가 어려운 점 양해부탁드립니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;4. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;만족스러운 답변이 되셨기를 바라며&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;답변 내용에 대한 추가 설명이 필요하신 경우&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;연천군 복지정책과 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;○○○ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;주무관&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;☎○○○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;○○○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;○○○○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;에게 연락주시면 친절히 답변해 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;드리도록 하겠습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:함초롬바탕"&gt;끝&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12.0pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;
